Phase 4.5c — Root Cause Found

The data IS in the database correctly. The bug is the nested join select("*, reps(name)"). PostgREST treats embedded resource joins as INNER JOINs by default. If the join result is filtered or blocked by RLS in any way, the entire parent row disappears silently — exactly like the companies bug we just fixed.

The solution is the same approach — avoid the nested join entirely. We already load all reps in loadAll(). We can look up the rep name from the reps list we already have in state instead of joining from the database.

